  "description": "The OXVA Nexlim Go Pod Vape Kit combines lightweight design with intelligent performance in one of the most portable dual mesh systems we’ve ever seen. Part of OXVA’s celebrated NeXlim Series, this device offers a smooth and simple experience, whether you prefer a tighter mouth-to-lung (MTL) draw or a more open restricted direct-lung (RDL) vape. Powered by a built-in 1800mAh battery and delivering up to 40W, the NeXlim Go automatically adjusts its power output based on the resistance of the pod in use—ideal for users who want excellent performance without complex settings. You can also toggle between Boost Mode for maximum flavour and vapour, or Eco Mode to extend coil life and preserve battery. An LED indicator keeps you updated on battery status, and USB-C fast charging ensures a full charge in under an hour. The kit comes with a refillable 2ml NeXlim Pod featuring OXVA’s Unitech 2.0 dual mesh coil technology, designed to deliver rich flavour and long-lasting performance. The side-adjustable airflow slider gives you full control over draw tightness, while the top-fill system and leak-resistant build make it clean and easy to use. The device is compatible with the full range of NeXlim pods, including 0.6ohm, 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm resistances, making it a versatile option for MTL and RDL vaping styles. Available in eight stylish colours, the OXVA NeXlim Go is a lightweight, intuitive device ideal for everyday use. Elevate your sessions by pairing this kit with premium vape juices .",
